        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Every creature in range hears only you — not each other, not their own spellcasting, not the building coming down. <b>Failure</b> a creature can't communicate, cast with verbal components, or benefit from any auditory effect but yours, and takes a −2 status penalty to all checks; once each, an ally of yours may spend Encore on its behalf to make it reroll a <i>successful</i> check and keep the worse result. For ten minutes you are the only thing being transmitted anywhere, and every Signal who has cast it describes it the same way: quiet.</p>"
